export async function invokeObsidianAction(action,payload={}){ const a=ObsidianActionAliases[action]; if(!a) throw new Error(`Unknown OBSIDIAN action: ${action}`); const req={operation:a.operation,...payload}; if(!(await confirmFlowExecution({key:a.endpoint,contract:{write:true,action:a.operation},payload:req,options:{}}))) throw new Error('Endpoint execution cancelled by user'); const res=await invoke(a.endpoint,{...req,__confirmedByUI:true}); return res?.data || res?.result || res; }

